	(text "Own QSPI bus, separate from the flash. Ciphertext only.\nCE pull-up keeps the part deselected during configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.764 147.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "553654b5-1711-4369-9606-95405257e9c1")
	)
	(text "ST33KTPM2X TPM on SPI from the loader domain (DB5174 rev 3, figure 3).\nRST driven by the FPGA with a 10k pull-down; 10k pull-up on PIRQ (mandatory).\n33R series on CLK/MOSI/MISO and 56p on CS: optional, fit as the layout requires.\nGPIO_PP, GPI_I2C_Select, I2C and NiC pins open (SPI mode). VPS slew 2 V/ms min (table 4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.714 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "58c1e28d-51cc-5cf9-bf4e-df69d0a2e5db")
	)
	(text "ESP-PSRAM64H: 8 MB ring buffer for SDcard"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 100.076 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "699018b9-7848-4fea-9466-3cfc5d394e23")
	)
	(text "Notes\n1. Root of trust = FPGA (eFuse key, authenticated bitstream) + QSPI flash + ST33KTPM2X TPM.\n2. Master SPI x4 at 3.3 V: VCCIOCFG = VCCIOL5 = 3.3 V, SCBV tied to VCCIOCFG (UG040012 Table 2-1).\n   Flash data and chip select are on bank L5 (User Banks L page); the clock is CFG_CLK.\n3. VCCB (battery-backed key RAM) is not used: tied to VCCA through R0 (Table 9-2). Keys are in eFuse.\n4. ADC: internal reference (VREFADC to ground). TSDP/TSDN grounded (unused); check UG040009.\n5. W25Q256JV-IQ ships with QE = 1; 4-byte address read opcodes are needed above 16 MB.\n6. The TPM is on its own SPI bus from the loader domain. The RTC I2C bus has pull-ups to 3V3_AO on its side,\n   to +3V3 on the FPGA side. RTC_INT_N and PB_N tell the boot ROM the boot cause.\n7. YSN8130E footprint: 3.2 x 2.5 mm, 10 pads, same pinout as Epson RX8130CE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.002 172.974 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7b9d49d3-8423-5e63-9a2c-2bc94fec93b4")
	)
	(text "FLASH_CLK_USR: optional fabric-driven clock (DNP link)\nif the CFG_CLK user-mode primitive is not used.\nIO_STATUS_C high: user I/O are high-Z during configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 92.075 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "81883d79-79c1-59d3-a305-090939923f24")
	)
	(text "TPM 2.0"
